WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Choose Send design changes.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.445
Describe what changed; if unchanged,
cancel and use Design Notes.

00:00:10.845 --> 00:00:14.482
Review destination, frames, appearance,
breakpoint and checked notes.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:20.427
Send, then check the saved design and
separate Slack status.

00:00:21.827 --> 00:00:26.373
Only authorized role holders who opted
into Slack receive messages.

00:00:27.773 --> 00:00:32.318
If a response is lost, reopen and Check
saved receipt.

00:00:33.718 --> 00:00:38.718
Resolve pending send recovers a receipt or
safely cancels the request.
